# Quality is best

We have just received a new collection of shells which are in the making for this next course starting March 1st. These drums are beautiful Ghanaian shells with Australian hide, all made by Nathaniel with only the very best sound in mind. Be sure to check out these drums if you are considering buying a new drum or your first drum. There are endless reasons on why these drums are so much better than store bought and Nathaniel can explain quality and warranty on viewing. Don't be fooled into buying a cheap first drum. If your drum sounds beautiful, you will want to play it and people around you will want you to play it! We are also doing school packages with these authentic quality instruments. What a treat when a school calls up and says they want something locally made and of the best quality! That's what we love to hear! So give us a call to arrange a viewing or chat to Nathaniel in class. Remember if you buy a drum you get a 5 week course FREE. If you have a drum already and you don't like the sound, chat with Nathaniel about putting a new skin on it. This can make all the difference. Phone 0434585992 for more information.
